[0.000, "o", "\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mSelect installation profile:\u001b[22m\u001b[33m  (enter/space to select)\u001b[39m\r\n  eks-multi-cluster-auto-peering-operator\r\n\u001b[2m    • Multicluster ambient mesh with helm-based peering\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m    • - Using Solo operator to install\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m    • - Use kgateway as ingress controller\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m    • - Cilium addon enabled\u001b[22m\r\n  eks-multi-cluster-peering-with-istio-ingress\r\n\u001b[2m    • Multicluster ambient mesh with helm-based peering\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m    • - Istio ingress enabled\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m    • - Cilium addon enabled\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[36m❯\u001b[39m \u001b[36meks-multi-cluster-peering-with-kgateway\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[2m\u001b[36m    • Multicluster ambient mesh with helm-based peering\u001b[39m\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m\u001b[36m    • - kgateway enabled\u001b[39m\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m\u001b[36m    • - Cilium addon enabled\u001b[39m\u001b[22m\r\n  eks-single-cluster-mesh-sidecar\r\n\u001b[2m    • Single-cluster classic Istio sidecar mesh (no ambient components) — starting point for the sidecar-to-ambient migration demo\u001b[22m\r\n  eks-single-cluster-mesh-with-calico\r\n\u001b[2m    • Single-cl"]
[0.000, "o", "uster ambient mesh with Calico\u001b[22m\r\n  eks-single-cluster-mesh-with-cilium\r\n\u001b[2m    • Single-cluster ambient mesh with Cilium CNI chaining\u001b[22m\r\n  eks-single-cluster-mesh-with-crl\r\n\u001b[2m    • Single-cluster ambient mesh with a plugged-in CA and certificate revocation list (CRL) enforcement\u001b[22m\r\n  eks-single-cluster-mesh-with-spire\r\n\u001b[2m    • Single-cluster ambient mesh with SPIRE workload identity attestation\u001b[22m\r\n"]
